### Experiment output (local dev artifacts) ###
# apps/api/scripts/run_experiment.py writes here. Everything in it is a
# regenerable product of a run — HTML/JSON reports, generated mission code,
# audit dumps — so the directory is ignored wholesale rather than pattern by
# pattern, which is how 3.9 MB of one-off reports ended up committed.
experiment-results/

### Local end-to-end run artifacts (screenshots, pulled deliverables, scratch drivers) ###
